title: Lane Change Turn Signal Flash Count
raw_community_title: Number of lane change blinks
category: Lighting
platform: Ranger (6G)
model_years: 2024+
trim: All
source_sheet: (2024+) 6G Ranger.xlsx
notes: '84=1, 8C=3, 90=4, 94=5, 98=6, etc.

  FORScan Menu: Lane Change Cancel Blink Number (Set to # of blinks (Default is 3))

  Confirmed: craigc (9/16/2024) Lariat'
